{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_title", "source_sha256": "02ee8420e1eb7d7d0dd7dc0e85ce759c70ed42b7c2f4a638a1db3d5c060cac3e", "ja": "まるで恋をするような", "zh": "宛如恋爱一般", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9c8356289eb73d1aea2965ed10bae650a0d41ea8dc8ba94f8da9e5f8f0ddc996", "ja": "センターを任されたあずさが、アダルティな\nメンバー達と目指す公演は、当然セクシー？\nだが思案顔のあずさは、心配する一同に、可\n愛い歌がいいと打ち明ける。あずさの憧れが\nつまった公演は、歓声に包まれるのだった。", "zh": "被委以C位重任的梓，与成熟性感的\n成员们所追求的公演，理所当然是性感风？\n然而面露难色的梓，向忧心忡忡的众人\n坦白了想唱可爱歌曲的心愿。这场凝聚着\n梓之憧憬的公演，最终在欢呼声中圆满落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1000_p", "source_sha256": "da5716580dca8dc67960b12da9f4043eeac02562cc595f712139016257548ec1", "ja": "（あずささんのセンター公演が終わった。今日で\nみんな、あずささんを好きになってしまったな……！）", "zh": "（梓小姐的中心公演结束了。今天大家都喜欢上梓小姐了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1001_010azu", "source_sha256": "85402eb05bf3ff9431ae9dfa3ce732ae4552dc8cc6cb639856e60d42076b9e31", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\n私、とうとう、やってしまいました……ふふっ。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n我终于……还是做到了呢……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "215f78156c99def4edca6067f866519dc0f5665941fbaaca2a5edf7371620aa9", "ja": "とってもドキドキしましたけど……\nそれより、本当に楽しかったです♪", "zh": "虽然心里一直怦怦直跳……\n但比起这个，真的非常开心呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3a211fbec065badaa1af92c67bf09c38dbbd017a9159f2436591373ef730425a", "ja": "お疲れさまでした、あずささん！\n言ったとおり、占いは外れましたね。", "zh": "辛苦了，梓小姐！\n正如我所说，占卜没准呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "5035f025b254cc96fe8da1b5e35a024f8fa5103c010c57b85ee8018491e3bddc", "ja": "まあ、{$P$}さんったら……\nそうですね。でも、外れてくれて、とっても幸せです。", "zh": "哎呀，{$P$}先生真是的……\n是啊。不过能算错，我真的特别幸福。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "114bbb2e088a95660d201ea8c6d0b610bee9d8dddffe6541728dc32cb347dc61", "ja": "あずさちゃん、お疲れさま！\nすごい盛り上がりだったわね～！", "zh": "梓，辛苦了！\n现场气氛真是太热烈了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d23e290ceb438c49f26422f62a7f6c27255f33f2e85e7807905257c26f462588", "ja": "本当に。もうアンコールも終わったのに、\nまだ盛り上がってるみたいです……！", "zh": "确实。明明连返场都结束了，感觉大家还沉浸在热烈的气氛中……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "32989850ae0576cc873bf2f815f9649cfb57d5ad15fe5ffcc2c94036601429a1", "ja": "うふふ、ありがとう。\nこんなに盛り上がったのも、みんなのおかげよ。", "zh": "呵呵，谢谢。\n能这么热闹，也多亏了大家呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1008_008tak", "source_sha256": "cfb08d4712a9fed0694c96d12927a4707f648253830c10452f60874c30538d69", "ja": "あずさ自身、楽しめたようで何よりです。\n私も、今日は新鮮な気持ちで臨む事ができました。", "zh": "看到梓自己也能享受其中，我就放心了。\n我今天也能以新鲜的心情投入其中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "b23fecc37112a9c9d98e358f57df3ba810c8cda380f492f9de20f836686bc8d3", "ja": "ちょっとちょっと、みんな聞こえてる？　この声！\nまだ続いてるわよ？", "zh": "等一下等一下，大家听得到吗？我的声音！\n还在继续哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1010_kyakuseki", "source_sha256": "f0505579cb5f3b2480ff0a0479309ebf5f27f5f64584b1961ceb624575ad5934", "ja": "アンコール！　アンコール！", "zh": "安可！安可！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1011_p", "source_sha256": "979033f7f3f37dc6187fb461e02fdd5c5d3abe9d14493d5e1be74f2401ceaf2c", "ja": "これは、まったく収まる気配がないな……。\nとりあえず、ナレーションを流して……。", "zh": "这完全没有要停下来的迹象啊……\n总之，先放一段旁白吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1012_010azu", "source_sha256": "c6f58c19d25b1ecd955acc519f8aaa91d4092be77a683b80844228db0c782cf7", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん。\nもう一曲だけ、やらせてもらえませんか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生。\n能不能让我，再唱一首歌呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1013_p", "source_sha256": "be4a4fe24978ac3f15857fa462ffdc6d279a37db05f3db69dc48d89674b844be", "ja": "えっ……あずささん？", "zh": "咦……梓小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "a667e3fa030c392e7d544857ed85351a4b57f85dc49839e9f9ccd43e68a050cd", "ja": "私、みんなに教えてもらったんです。\n自分の希望を伝えることって、大切なんだって……。", "zh": "我啊，是大家教会我的。\n把自己的心愿说出来，是很重要的事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "8108ba83ab4eb4b693854d1901eb873d0e69bcbee05d71c6639b8872534c04d3", "ja": "みんなも……よかったらあと少しだけ、\nお願いしてもいいかしら？", "zh": "大家……如果方便的话，\n还能再陪我任性一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1016_039kon", "source_sha256": "ea9c3bf3e4c8448d2db0b47d122009f7d107b7c301b639337662780db4bdbebd", "ja": "もちろん！　遠慮しないでって言ったじゃない。\n今日はとことん、盛り上がっちゃいましょ！", "zh": "当然好啦！我不都说了不用客气嘛。\n今天就尽情嗨个够吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1017_008tak", "source_sha256": "9c4ecf93144632e8c9ec551d27ec7051aea48bec5c8762cd1d32ec76dff4ce03", "ja": "ええ、私も……こうしてあずさの歌声を\n待ち望む方々の声には、応えるのが務めかと。", "zh": "是的，我也觉得……回应这些翘首期盼着听到梓歌声的人们，是我的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9e6795de0dd502579cad72a2d598e14d92cfb62dbc20177f7afc433377e06b84", "ja": "私も、まだまだやれますよ！\nバテたりしてません！　ね、莉緒さん♪", "zh": "我也还能继续哦！\n才没有累得不行呢！对吧，莉绪姐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1019_046rio", "source_sha256": "94aa64b62c4ae4175a21386d17d41e54039e9cb0d525fe21ac469533e23c8d16", "ja": "もちろんよ、風花ちゃん♪\n私たちの魅力、もっともっと見せつけちゃうわよ～！", "zh": "当然啦，风花♪\n把我们的魅力，更尽情地展现出来吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1020_p", "source_sha256": "e2d0b0f9743fb615b51a630d59edddb820a4fa2c169787fe5b7e615e8f550716", "ja": "そういう事なら……わかりました！\n時間は調整しますから、ラスト一曲、お願いします！", "zh": "既然这样……我明白了！时间我会协调，最后再唱一首，拜托了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1021_010azu", "source_sha256": "6569d66bb63eda1899ac77261e0c32b4f486fcbda3805440a60bf894f6635c7a", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}さん。\nすみません、最後までワガママばっかりで……。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}先生。\n对不起，一直到最后都在任性地提要求……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1022_p", "source_sha256": "e013af495702bdf3a04865d58ad07f22cdd64ccfe893985eb638913acc15a221", "ja": "いえ、もっと言ってもらえると助かります。\n頼ってもらってこその、プロデューサーですから。", "zh": "不，你能多跟我说说反而帮大忙了。\n正因为被你依靠，我才算得上是个制作人嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1023_010azu", "source_sha256": "d2a4dad51de5e49635a60b6ab1f2692616cff0b54f126742073dd62b655b9046", "ja": "まあ……。\nでも、本当に甘えちゃっていいんですか？", "zh": "哎呀……\n不过，我真的可以这么依赖您吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1024_046rio", "source_sha256": "0b2d45a31d9a35b3a15e229c53f21d6a937abee7ac338c73652870155e4b5219", "ja": "ちょ、ちょっとちょっと！\n何ふたりで、いい雰囲気になっちゃってるのよー！？", "zh": "等、等一下！\n你们两个怎么突然变得这么亲密了呀——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1025_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9c320f7c5b59c7ae279e17b822243eff007ab434c098419ce5ca4898877aede0", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\n鼻の下……のびてますよ……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……您的鼻子下面……拉得老长哦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1026_p", "source_sha256": "2f6015246c7896136ef1b82bc83f329d3175e7100fc704a499ca5bd5754ecc59", "ja": "えっ。", "zh": "咦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1027_010azu", "source_sha256": "09a0823d08445fbfd83b8de9fcc069372232f811a256fcca4bde10c00ab9ae1c", "ja": "あら、もう時間……\nそれでは、いってきますね！", "zh": "哎呀，已经到时间了……\n那我出发了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1028_p", "source_sha256": "171bb775ebddf200c2e612b8b55ee60daad0139b9071451ae7361bdd0d180825", "ja": "（あずささん達が飛び出していった途端、\n割れるような歓声がステージの裏まで響いてくる）", "zh": "（あずさ小姐她们一离开，震耳欲聋的欢呼声就从舞台后方传了过来。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_053_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_053_1029_p", "source_sha256": "0ccda6e99aec8a8921d60c93ec4cc3df0c5fe9aaeb3e9efe0bb2733005adb98c", "ja": "（アイドルが輝く事が、プロデューサーの願い……\n今日のあずささんの姿で、またひとつ願いが叶ったな）", "zh": "（偶像能够绽放光彩，就是制作人的愿望……今天的梓小姐如此耀眼，又有一个愿望实现了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
